{"author":{"id":"337a442880d7106d509ff84f2f7fef51acce8bce88b081d4f4c3f0298b7e7941"},"ops":[{"type":3,"timestamp":1791827078,"nonce":"ALaBukwtAhsxtqEw80GT6euk+XQ=","message":"Decision: a detail page counts as pulled when some job row with the same normalize_apply_url key has resolve_attempts\u003e0, needs_resolve=0, a non-empty description and completeness 'full'; resolve copies description, completeness, employment_type and apply_url from that row and makes no request. Reason: the ticket asks to reuse stored detail by URL. A failed fetch leaves needs_resolve=1 and a partial one is not 'full', so neither is reused. Rows whose listing already carried text (resolve_attempts=0) are not donors, because no detail page was ever read for them.","files":null}]}